<title>THAILAND: Lehman, Salomon to lead Thai Yankee bonds.</title>
<headline>Lehman, Salomon to lead Thai Yankee bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Finance Ministry said on Monday that Lehman Brothers and Salomon Inc had been chosen to lead manage the country's upcoming US$500 million Yankee bond issue.</p>
</text>
